</sec>
<sec id="acknowledgements">
  <title>Acknowledgements</title>
  <p>We thank Innovamat Education for their support in the development
  of this open source work.</p>
</sec>
<sec id="ai-usage-disclosure">
  <title>AI usage disclosure</title>
  <p>The core architecture and foundational algorithms were developed
  prior to the widespread adoption of generative AI. However, during
  recent development cycles, AI assistants were utilized to assist in
  refactoring, homogenizing interfaces, and expanding specific
  functionalities. Cursor’s Composer 2 was used in 2025 for code
  completion and refactoring; Claude Opus 5 (August 2026) and Claude
  Fable 5.1 (October 2026) for code, tests and documentation; and Claude
  Fable 5.1 and Claude Opus 5.5 for drafting revised sections of this
  paper. The author made the design decisions, reviewed, edited and
  tested all AI-generated content, and takes full responsibility for the
  software and the paper.</p>
</sec>
<sec id="conflicts-of-interest">
  <title>Conflicts of Interest</title>
  <p>The author is employed by Innovamat Education, which uses CogStim
  in its assessments.</p>
</sec>
